  "termsSection3Body": "Every transfer, approval, or swap you send is broadcast to the EVM network you selected. Gas estimates are best-effort and the final cost is determined by the network. You are responsible for verifying recipient addresses and paying all network fees.",
  "termsSection4Title": "4. Third-Party Services & Swaps",
  "termsSection4Body": "The app relies on RPC providers (e.g., Alchemy and any custom RPC you add), CoinGecko, and public AMM routers such as Uniswap, QuickSwap, PancakeSwap, and SushiSwap. Service interruptions, inaccurate market data, or smart-contract bugs can cause losses or failed transactions. We do not audit tokens, pools, or smart contracts.",
  "termsSection5Title": "5. Compliance & Taxes",
  "termsSection5Body": "You are solely responsible for determining whether your use of Owllet is legal in your jurisdiction and for paying any taxes or reporting obligations related to your digital-asset activity.",
  "termsSection6Title": "6. Prohibited Use",
  "termsSection6Body": "You may not use the app for illicit activity, sanctions evasion, malware distribution, or to violate the terms of any blockchain, RPC provider, or applicable law. We reserve the right to disable access to network features that are abused.",
  "termsSection7Title": "7. Disclaimer of Warranties",
  "termsSection7Body": "The app is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee that price data is accurate, that transactions will succeed, or that the software is error-free.",
  "termsSection8Title": "8. Limitation of Liability",
  "termsSection8Body": "To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for lost funds, lost seed phrases, market losses, smart-contract exploits, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising out of your use of the app.",
  "termsSection9Title": "9. Changes & Contact",
  "termsSection9Body": "We may update these terms as we launch new features or networks. Continued use after a change means you accept the new terms. Contact us on X (@fomowlhq) if you need clarification.",
  "termsEffectiveDate": "Effective date: February 2026",
  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacySection1Title": "1. Overview",
  "privacySection1Body": "Owllet is an EVM-only, self-custody wallet. All key generation and signing happen on your device using battle-tested BIP-39/BIP-32 libraries. We never run a centralized ledger or take possession of your assets.",
  "privacySection2Title": "2. Data Stored Locally",
  "privacySection2Body": "We store the following items with Flutter Secure Storage or SharedPreferences on your device:\n• Wallet names, addresses, and derivation indexes\n• Encrypted private keys, seed phrase (if you save it), and your passcode hash\n• Biometric toggles plus language/UI preferences\nDeleting the app or clearing secure storage permanently removes this data. It never leaves your device.",
  "privacySection3Title": "3. Third-Party Services",
  "privacySection3Body": "To display balances, price data, and execute swaps the app connects directly to:\n• RPC providers such as Alchemy and any custom RPC you add\n• CoinGecko for market data and charts\n• Public AMM routers (Uniswap, QuickSwap, PancakeSwap, SushiSwap, etc.) when you submit swaps or approvals\nThese providers may log IP addresses or wallet activity under their own policies.",
  "privacySection4Title": "4. Device Permissions",
  "privacySection4Body": "Camera access is used only for QR scanning. Biometric prompts (Face/Touch ID, fingerprint) are handled by the operating system; we receive only success/failure. We do not access your photos, contacts, microphone, or location.",
  "privacySection5Title": "5. Your Responsibilities",
  "privacySection5Body": "• Back up your 12-word seed phrase offline and never share it\n• Verify destination addresses and approvals before signing\n• Keep your device updated, set a strong passcode, and enable biometrics\n• Understand that blockchain transactions are irreversible",
  "privacySection6Title": "6. Updates & Contact",
  "privacySection6Body": "We may revise this notice as we add networks or features. The latest version is always available in the app. Reach us on X (@fomowlhq) if you have privacy questions.",
  "privacyLastUpdated": "Last updated: February 2026",
